:0},"body":"I have a `Products` table, which has a field `default_sku` corresponding to an entry in the table `Skus`, which has a field `default_image` corresponding to an entry in the table `Medias`.\nWith defined associations : \n\n``` php\n        $this->hasOne('DefaultSku', [\n            'className' => 'Skus',\n            'foreignKey' => false,\n            'conditions' => [$this->alias().'.default_sku = DefaultSku.id']\n        ]);\n```\n\nAnd\n\n``` php\n        $this->hasOne('DefaultImage', [\n            'className' => 'Media.Medias',\n            'foreignKey' => false,\n            'conditions' => [$this->alias().'.default_image = DefaultImage.id']\n        ]);\n```\n\nI retrieve the associations like this:\n\n``` php\n        $artist = $this->Artists->get($id, [\n            'contain' => ['Photo', 'Products.DefaultSku.DefaultImage']\n        ]);\n```\n\nCakephp tries to convert the default_image association to an int : \n\n``` php\n    Notice (8): Object of class Media\\Model\\Entity\\Media could not be converted to int [CORE/src/Database/Type/IntegerType.php, line 62]\n```\n\nIt only does this when the DefaultImage association property name is the same as the database field (default_image). If I change the property to DefaultImaged for example, works good.\nNotice that it doesn't do it for the DefaultSku association even if the database field is the same name than the association (default_sku), this time it gets correctly replace by the Sku entity.\n","closed_by":{"login":"yachaka","id":8074336,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNzQzMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8074336?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka","html_url":"https://github.com/yachaka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yachaka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/6372/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/6372/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}